It\u8217\'92s been around a century since the Bureau Wars came to a close; the event most people thought would define their lifetime. After the Bureau of Internal Investigation and their allies were finally put down, the Galaxy could begin to heal.}
\par \pard\plain \s21\rtlch\af5\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af0\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f0\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe1081\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s21\rtlch\af5\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af0\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f0\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe1081\ql{\loch
If only it had been that simple.}
\par \pard\plain \s21\rtlch\af5\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af0\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f0\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe1081\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s21\rtlch\af5\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af0\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f0\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe1081\ql{\loch
The Calamity struck seventy years ago. Its cause was, and continues to be unknown, but its effect was overwhelming and undeniable; the deaths of billions, and the total collapse of galactic civilizations. Systems with a hypergate were particularly badly affected, becoming irradiated and totally uninhabitable for years to come. And yet, somehow, humanity survived.}
\par \pard\plain \s21\rtlch\af5\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af0\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f0\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe1081\ql\loch

\par \pard\plain \s21\rtlch\af5\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af0\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f0\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe1081\ql{\loch
And so your journey begins. You are one of many pilots wandering the stricken galaxy, trying to find a way for yourself by the light of dying stars. The universe, with all its joys and sorrows, all its horrors and comforts, awaits you, captain. Perhaps, amidst it, you\u8217\'92ll find the answer to the most important question of all.}
\par \pard\plain \s21\rtlch\af5\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af0\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f0\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe1081\ql\loch

