A word of caution}
\par \pard\plain \s21\rtlch\af5\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af0\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f0\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe1081\ql{\rtlch\afs24\ab0 \ltrch\loch\fs24\b0\loch
White Dwarf contains many changes from the systems of EV Nova, and breaks many previously established conventions of the EV series. If you\u8217\'92re a veteran of the series, make sure you keep an open mind going in; not everything may be as you expected. Many of these systems changes will be familiar to those of you who played Brave New Void.}
\par \pard\plain \s21\rtlch\af5\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af0\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f0\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe1081\ql\rtlch\afs24 \ltrch\loch\fs24\loch

