\par \pard\plain \s21\rtlch\af5\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af0\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f0\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe1081\ql{\loch
1) Make a copy of your EV Nova folder. Yes, the whole thing.}
\par \pard\plain \s21\rtlch\af5\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af0\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f0\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe1081\ql{\loch
2) In the copy, delete the folder called \u8220\'93Nova Files.\u8221\'94 Do not delete this folder in the original.}
\par \pard\plain \s21\rtlch\af5\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af0\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f0\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe1081\ql{\loch
3) Move the included folder called \u8220\'93Nova Files\u8221\'94 from the White Dwarf folder to the copied EV Nova folder.}
\par \pard\plain \s21\rtlch\af5\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af0\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f0\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe1081\ql{\loch
